"""Full lesson pages for the 28 basic-grammar lessons, laid out like the Tense lessons.

Each entry: hook (เทียบกับภาษาไทย), vis (pictures), f (structure boxes), ex (examples), mis (✗ → ✓, why), tip, story (EN with **marked** words, TH).
Pictures:
  ('blocks', [(row label, [(text, role), ...]), ...], caption)   roles: S V O BE AUX NOT Q A ADV T P C X
  ('table', [headers], [[cells], ...], caption)
  ('scale', [(word, percent, meaning), ...], caption)
  ('nest', [(word, time, place), ...], caption)         biggest frame first
  ('steps', [step, ...], caption)
"""

